
==========================================================================
  NESTED APPLY / CURRYING SANITY CHECK
==========================================================================

Testing compose_n : (Q⊸Q)^n ⊸ (Q ⊸ Q) with n=2,3,4.
After applying all f_i, the result is the composition f_1 ∘ ... ∘ f_n.


==========================================================================
  Part 1: compose_2
==========================================================================
Type: (Q⊸Q) ⊸ (Q⊸Q) ⊸ (Q ⊸ Q)
Definition: λf_1. λf_2. λx. f_1(f_2(x))

Compile abstract compose_2:
6 qubits, 0 gates
  perm: [4, 5, 3, 2, 0, 1]
  ✓ compose_2(H, S) = S ; H (fidelity=1.000000)
  ✓ compose_2(H, H) = H ; H = id_Q (fidelity=1.000000)
  ✓ compose_2(T, S) = S ; T (fidelity=1.000000)

